## Suggested Learning Order

For a learner focused on business analytics and practical AI applications, consider this sequence:

1. Python, SQL, Pandas, NumPy, Excel, Power BI, DAX, and Power Query
2. GitHub, Streamlit, and one deployment platform
3. AI productivity tools and no-code/low-code automation
4. Scikit-learn and machine learning fundamentals
5. LLM APIs, embeddings, RAG, and one agent framework
6. Cloud AI fundamentals and deployment
7. MLOps, model serving, and advanced LLM engineering
8. Quantum, robotics, and edge AI only if they align with a specific goal

